---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="cta" tint class="text-center">
  <h2 class="h2 reveal mx-auto">Take nobody&rsquo;s word for it.</h2>

  <p class="lede reveal mx-auto mt-6" style="--reveal-delay:60ms">
    Read the Index, the method, and the evidence. We show our working, including where it broke.
  </p>

  {/* The benchmark is not on this branch: the scorer is stubbed, and a live
      benchmark returning a fixed verdict would be worse than none. So the
      primary action here is the pull-request verifier waitlist, which keeps its
      Loops "verify-pr" userGroup via the shared data-verify-cta modal. */}
  <div
    class="reveal mt-9 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"
    style="--reveal-delay:120ms"
  >
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-verify-cta>Join the waitlist</button>
    <a href="/the-index" class="btn btn-secondary">Read the Index</a>
  </div>

  <p class="reveal mx-auto mt-6 text-[13px] text-fg-2" style="--reveal-delay:180ms;max-width:48ch">
    A verifier that runs on every pull request, on your own repositories, is in development.
  </p>
</Section>
